{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877200/extras/14d1e6ead129d7532833e693b502bca9.poster.avif?t=1768022274\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877200/extras/14d1e6ead129d7532833e693b502bca9.webm?t=1768022274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877200/extras/14d1e6ead129d7532833e693b502bca9.mp4?t=1768022274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TURBOCIDE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a classic arena chaos with a modern PS2-era attitude. built for speed, style, and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master Aura Walk, dodges, wall jumps, crouch high jumps, alt-fire weapons, and combo melee across a roster of playable avatars and Maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877200/extras/8df98fa4174a5f5cc9ef457d40d1f8df.poster.avif?t=1768022274\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877200/extras/8df98fa4174a5f5cc9ef457d40d1f8df.webm?t=1768022274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877200/extras/8df98fa4174a5f5cc9ef457d40d1f8df.mp4?t=1768022274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Core Combat</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turbo Power: Gain kills to Earn Speed and Movement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aura Walk:</strong> combat movement state for aggressive repositioning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge Tech:</strong> close-range duels and burst avoidance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall Jumping + Crouch High Jump:</strong> vertical routes and surprise angles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo Melee:</strong> chain Mlee hits,Air Strikes to reposition yourself quickly in the air</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alt-Fire Weapons:</strong> secondary fire adds tactical options to your play style<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877200/extras/b09fb514bb1354082ca12d3221dcc5de.poster.avif?t=1768022274\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877200/extras/b09fb514bb1354082ca12d3221dcc5de.webm?t=1768022274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877200/extras/b09fb514bb1354082ca12d3221dcc5de.mp4?t=1768022274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modes + Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture the Flag (CTF)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Deathmatch (TDM)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deathmatch (DM)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 maps</strong>, <strong>22 playable avatars</strong>, <strong>bots supported</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline and Online play supported</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps